37
00:01:49.117 --> 00:01:57.951
Take turns, Take turns! Wait patiently, Wait patiently! Knock first, Knock first! Cover your mouth, Cover your mouth!

38
00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:08.095
Use kind words, Use kind words! Hold the door, Hold the door! Ask nicely, Ask nicely! Return things, Return things!

39
00:02:08.395 --> 00:02:10.885
